    - Term: Dialogue/GameplayIntro_Line2
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Taking <b>Jalan Tikus</b> burns ENERGY fast.
      - Lewat <b>Jalan Tikus</b> begini bakal nguras tenaga, nih.
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue/GameplayIntro_Line3
      TermType: 0
