      - Pokoknya gue harus ampe <b>CHECKPOINT</b> sebelum <b>ENERGY</b> gue habis!
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue/PinkIntro_Line1
      TermType: 0
